  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Kayla shoulder bag is crafted in pebbled leather that holds its shape. Two interior pockets keep things where you put them. The strap adjusts from shoulder to crossbody—because sometimes you need both hands for coffee. We get it.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Removeable shoulder strap with 8.5&quot; drop, removeable and adjustable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 slip pocket, 1 zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.43&quot; (L) x 6.3&quot; (H) x 3.15&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
